{
  "description": "Keep Dataplex's unstructured-data profile scans after a discovery flap. Google's REST reference (projects.locations.dataScans, checked 2026-10-09) still documents DataScan.unstructuredDataProfileSpec/Result, launched in Preview (REST only) on 2026-06-11 with no deprecation notice. Discovery alternates between revision 20260929 (has them) and 20261005 (drops them), and spec-mirror-gcp 42a9a9f captured the latter. This patch restores the unstructured/graph profile shapes, the DataScan and DataScanJob members, the UNSTRUCTURED_DATA_PROFILE type enum values, and DataDiscoverySpecStorageConfig.unstructuredDataOptions, copied from the revision 20260929 model.",
